>beginner opening guide</a>. If you have a few wins under your belt, jump straight to the archetype that fits your playstyle.</p><p>These guides assume you already know the building names — if any callout below feels unfamiliar, open the<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/buildings\\\">buildings database</a> <!-- -->in a second tab. For the macro choice of which archetype to run, the<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/strategy\\\">strategies page</a> <!-- -->has a 30-second decision tree.</p></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 pt-4\\\"><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner-sm p-5 bg-bunker-900/40\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 mb-2\\\">Reading path by skill level</h2><div class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2\\\"><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">First match</span> →<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/guides/beginner-opening-guide\\\">Beginner opening guide</a>. Stops you losing in the first 5 minutes.</p><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">First wins</span> →<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/guides/economy-first-build-order\\\">Economy First build order</a>. The safest way to a consistent top finish.</p><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">Aggressive players</span> →<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/guides/air-rush-conquest-playbook\\\">Air Rush conquest playbook</a>. The all-in tempo opener.</p></div></div><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner-sm p-5 bg-bunker-900/40\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 mb-2\\\">Topics covered</h2><div class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2\\\"><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">Build orders</span> — the exact placement order for the firs